   S. and Weierstall, Uwe and Liu, Wei and Babaoglu, Kerim and Moore, Eric
   L. and Katz, Ryan D. and Shipman, Jennifer M. and Garcia-Calvo,
   Margarita and Sharma, Sujata and Sheth, Payal and Soisson, Stephen M.
