   Gutkowski, P (Corresponding Author), Fdn InterAmer Corazon Argentina FIC, Gest Comunicac Org, Area Comunicac, Buenos Aires, DF, Argentina.
   Tiscornia, V (Corresponding Author), Fdn InterAmer Corazon Argentina FIC, Nutr Humana, Buenos Aires, DF, Argentina.
