Author = {Rodrigues, Richard R. and Gurung, Manoj and Li, Zhipeng and
   Garcia-Jaramillo, Manuel and Greer, Renee and Gaulke, Christopher and
   Bauchinger, Franziska and You, Hyekyoung and Pederson, Jacob W. and
   Vasquez-Perez, Stephany and White, Kimberly D. and Frink, Briana and
   Philmus, Benjamin and Jump, Donald B. and Trinchieri, Giorgio and Berry,
